Revelation of the Book ﴿تَنْـزِيلُ الكِتابِ﴾, that is: this is the revelation of the Book

from Allah, ﴿مِنَ اللهِ﴾, the ﴿العَزِيزِ﴾, that is, the One who is invulnerable by His dominion, so that no one who fabricates speech can attribute fabrication to Him;

﴿العَلِيمِ﴾, the All-Knowing of those who believe in it and of those who deny it. This is a warning to the polytheists and good news to the believers.

ِAnd for you in them are benefits: namely, the milk and the wool;

﴿and that you may reach by them a need in your breasts﴾, i.e., that you may reach by them whatever matters you need;

﴿and on them﴾, and on the ships,

﴿and on the ship you are carried﴾. I.e., you are not carried on the cattle alone, but on them and on ships, on land and at sea.
